OL,3,GNEWSANew Thames lifeboat station
OL,4,A'already saving lives'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal National Lifeboat Institution
OL,7,F(RNLI) has opened its first new base on
OL,8,Fthe River Thames in 24 years which the
OL,9,Fcharity says will help crews reach
OL,10,Femergencies more quickly, and is
OL,11,Falready saving lives.
OL,13,FThe new Wandsworth Riverside station
OL,14,Freplaces the RNLI's former base in
OL,15,FChiswick and will serve as headquarters
OL,16,Ffor 66 volunteers and 10 permanent
OL,17,Fstaff.
OL,19,FThe Chiswick site in west London was
OL,20,Fone of four lifeboat stations
OL,21,Festablished on the river following the
OL,22,FMarchioness disaster in August 1989.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
